2. **`extract_urls(text)`**: This function uses a regular expression to extract all URLs from the provided text.
3. **`extract_domain(url)`**: This function extracts the domain from a given URL using `urlparse`.
4. **`get_domain_geolocation(url)`**: This function extracts the domain from a URL, gets the IP address of the domain, and then retrieves geolocation data for that IP address.
5. **`analyze_urls(text)`**: This function orchestrates the process by extracting URLs, getting geolocation data for each domain, and returning the results.

